ific format (e.g., MM/DD/YYYY) during initialization, causing form submission to use this format instead of the expected ISO format (YYYY-MM-DD).","repair_strategy":"For non-inline datepickers attached to input elements, create a hidden input sibling to hold the actual value (in ISO format via joined selectedDates) and remove the name from the visible input so only the hidden input is submitted. The visible input retains the locale-formatted date for usability.","edits":[{"path":"js/src/datepicker.ts","sha256":"333ada052b9200667edf9078b105036dee5c1406a86e3865f6534e2ddb18c53a","before":"// For inline mode, look for a hidden input child to bind to\n    if (this._isInline && !this._isInput) {\n      this._boundInput = this._element.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input[type=\"hidden\"], input[name]')\n    }\n\n    this._positionElement = this._resolvePositionElement()","after":"// For inline mode, look for a hidden input child to bind to\n    if (this._isInline && !this._isInput) {\n      this._boundInput = this._element.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input[type=\"hidden\"], input[name]')\n    }\n\n    // ADD: For non-inline mode, create a hidden input sibling to hold the actual value\n    if (this._isInput && !this._isInline) {\n      this._boundInput = document.createElement('input');\n      this._boundInput.type = 'hidden';\n      this._boundInput.name = this._element.name; // preserve the name\n      this._element.removeAttribute('name'); // so the visible input is not submitted\n      this._element.parentNode.insertBefore(this._boundInput, this._element.nextSibling);\n    }\n\n    this._positionElement = this._resolvePositionElement()"}],"expected_accessibility_effect":"No change to accessibility as accessible names/roles remain intact; visible input stays focusable and labeled, hidden input is not exposed to assistive technology.","functional_risks":["Client-side validation/scripting relying on visible input's value may break due to locale format","Multiple se